<h1>Privacy notice</h1>

<p>This notice explains how Meridian Castings Limited handles personal data collected through the Meridian Portal. The data controller is Meridian Castings Limited, Riverside Way, Attercliffe, Sheffield, S9 2FL, United Kingdom, company number 00841766.</p>

<p>We collect account details for staff and supplier users of the portal, including name, work email address and site location, in order to provide access to order status, drawings and invoices relevant to that account. We also collect basic page-view information, described in our <a href="/legal/cookies">cookie policy</a>, to understand which parts of the portal are used and to identify pages that need improvement.</p>

<p>Personal data is retained for as long as the associated account is active, plus a limited period afterwards for audit purposes, in line with our standard record-keeping requirements. Data is not sold or shared with third parties for their own marketing purposes. Requests to access, correct or delete personal data held about you should be sent through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, marked for the attention of the data protection lead.</p>

<p>This notice sits alongside our <a href="/legal/terms">terms of use</a> and our <a href="/legal/cookies">cookie policy</a>, and is reviewed at least once a year.</p>
